        [[ 8.4      ,  7.       ,  9.       ],
          [11.4      , 10.       , 12.       ]]], dtype=float32)>

  Args:
    image: RGB image or images. The size of the last dimension must be 3.
    delta: float.  How much to add to the hue channel.
    name: A name for this operation (optional).

